      "end": 56.54,
      "text": "One glass too far, one truth too late",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 56.54,
      "end": 60.18,
      "text": "I can make a real move, I can make a hard way",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 60.18,
      "end": 64.16,
      "text": "But when I tell her what I drink, she's headed for the door",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 64.16,
      "end": 68.78,
      "text": "I'm single on the market with one glass too far",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 75.02,
      "end": 77.24,
      "text": "She said, are you kidding?",
      "uncertain": false
